@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About — Pollmaster</PageTitle>

<div class="p-4">
    <h1>Pollmaster</h1>
    <p class="lead">
        Pollmaster visualizes Polish air-quality data from GIOŚ (Główny Inspektorat Ochrony Środowiska)
        on an interactive map. The client talks to a Pollmaster backend that proxies and caches
        the GIOŚ REST API, so the app stays responsive even when upstream rate-limits hit.
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>Source: <code>https://api.gios.gov.pl/pjp-api/v1/rest/</code></li>
        <li>Backend: <code>Pollmaster.Api</code> (ASP.NET Core)</li>
        <li>Client: .NET MAUI Blazor Hybrid + Leaflet.js</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        Data is provided by GIOŚ under the terms of the
        <a href="https://powietrze.gios.gov.pl/pjp/content/api">portal regulations</a>.
        Measurements are advisory only and may be revised by GIOŚ later.
    </p>
</div>
